#: ../../source/buffer_README.md:150
msgid ""
"`BrowserBuffer` is the browser `buffer` module (this repo). `Uint8Array` "
"is included as a sanity check (since `BrowserBuffer` uses `Uint8Array` "
"under the hood, `Uint8Array` will always be at least a bit faster). "
"Finally, `NodeBuffer` is the node.js buffer module, which is included to "
"compare against."
